{
  "_source": "hermes-agent@d350422b hooks.md + fire sites (model_tools.py, hermes_cli/plugins.py, agent/turn_*.py, agent/api_request_hooks.py, agent/conversation_loop.py, gateway/run_agent_cache.py)",
  "_about": "Contract fixture: realistic kwargs for every hook the plugin registers. 'reads' lists the keys the plugin depends on; tests/test_hermes_contract.py fails if a Hermes version stops sending any of them. Strings containing SENTINEL must never appear in anything the plugin records. 'optional_reads' may be absent on older supported Hermes versions (the plugin must then record UNKNOWN, never a default); 'optional_hook' may have no fire site at all.",
